# Original phone videos are too big for the site; compress_media.sh makes .mp4 copies to commit instead
*.MOV
*.mov
# Original sunrise/sunset photos are big and can contain GPS location; compress_media.sh makes .web.jpg copies to commit
*.heic
*.heif
files/sunrises/*/**/*.jpg
files/sunrises/*/**/*.jpeg
files/sunrises/*/**/*.png
files/sunsets/*/**/*.jpg
files/sunsets/*/**/*.jpeg
files/sunsets/*/**/*.png
!files/sunrises/**/*.web.jpg
!files/sunsets/**/*.web.jpg
# Photo/video metadata saved by files/strip_metadata.py (GPS, dates): stays on this computer only
media_metadata.json
